<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prijsdaling</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #10b981; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
        .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .price-box { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .old-price { color: #6b7280; text-decoration: line-through; font-size: 18px; }
        .new-price { color: #10b981; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; }
        .savings { color: #10b981; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1 style="margin: 0;">Goed nieuws!</h1>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">De prijs is gedaald</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hoi,</p>
        <p>De prijs van <strong>{{ productName }}</strong> is gedaald!</p>
        
        <div class="price-box">
            <div class="old-price">&euro; {{ oldPrice }}</div>
            <div class="new-price">&euro; {{ newPrice }}</div>
            {% if priceChangePercent %}
            <div class="savings">{{ priceChangePercent|abs|number_format(1) }}% goedkoper</div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        
        <p style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ url }}" class="button">Bekijk product</a>
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Je ontvangt deze e-mail omdat je een prijswatch hebt ingesteld op ShopQ.</p>
        <p>ShopQ - Automatische prijsmonitoring</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
